        "label": "Raw request and errors",
        "disabled": false,
        "info": "The top row calls GET /media/v1/media-items through the generic request node. The bottom row requests a profile id that does not exist and sends the API error to a Catch node. msg.statusCode and msg.subsplash.error.code are available on that message. Package: @brettgoodrich/node-red-subsplash. Palette category: Subsplash."
    },
